{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "🚀 Smart City IDS - Live Demo",
    "tags": ["demo", "smart-city", "security"],
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "🏗️ INFRASTRUCTURE",
        "type": "stat",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "count(kube_pod_info{namespace='smart-city'})",
          "legendFormat": "12 Services Running"
        }],
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green"},
            "thresholds": {"steps": [{"value": null, "color": "green"}]}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "🛡️ SECURITY STACK",
        "type": "stat",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "count(kube_pod_info{namespace='falco-system'}) + count(kube_pod_info{namespace='monitoring'})",
          "legendFormat": "5 Monitoring Pods"
        }],
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"}
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "📊 SERVICE DISTRIBUTION",
        "type": "barchart",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "count by (app) (kube_pod_info{namespace='smart-city'})",
          "legendFormat": "{{app}}"
        }],
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6}
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "🎯 DEMO READY",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0},
        "options": {
          "content": "# ✅ SMART CITY IDS READY\n\n## 🎯 Demo Features:\n- **12 Smart City Services**\n- **Falco Security Monitoring**\n- **Suricata Network IDS**\n- **LLM-Powered Analysis**\n- **Real-time Dashboards**\n\n## 📊 Live Metrics:\n- Service Health\n- Security Alerts\n- Performance Data\n- Automated Responses",
          "mode": "markdown"
        }
      }
    ],
    "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"}
  },
  "folderId": 0,
  "overwrite": true
}
